# ============================================================
# exploratory_dust_share_timeseries.R
# Ad hoc / exploratory -- NOT part of the 00_run_all.R pipeline.
#
# Population-weighted dust PM2.5 by month-year:
#   (1) national
#   (2) by Census region (same 4-region crosswalk as Fig 3 / 47_fig3_dr.R)
#   (3) dust share of total PM2.5 (pop-weighted dust / pop-weighted total),
#       national and by region
#
# No mortality-sample filtering (no lag/temp/deaths>0 requirements) --
# this is a pure exposure descriptive, so the only filters are
# non-missing dust/total PM2.5 and positive population weight.
# Coverage: 2000-2019 (analysis_panel_monthly.parquet's range; the
# published Fig 1 exposure maps use a longer 2000-2022 external series
# not fully in this repo -- see 00_run_all.R Stage 3 comment).
# ============================================================
source("Code/00_utils.R")
#   (3) dust share of total PM2.5 (pop-weighted dust / pop-weighted total),
#       national and by region
#
# No mortality-sample filtering (no lag/temp/deaths>0 requirements) --
# this is a pure exposure descriptive, so the only filters are
# non-missing dust/total PM2.5 and positive population weight.
# Coverage: 2000-2019 (analysis_panel_monthly.parquet's range; the
# published Fig 1 exposure maps use a longer 2000-2022 external series
# not fully in this repo -- see 00_run_all.R Stage 3 comment).
# ============================================================
